      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 196,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4349,
      "text": "[The warner] said, “Even if I bring you a better guidance than what you have found your forefathers upon?” They said, “We totally reject what you [prophets] have been sent with.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4350,
      "text": "So We took revenge on them; see what was the end of the deniers!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 425,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4351,
      "text": "And [remember] when Abraham said to his father and his people, “I disown all that you worship,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4352,
      "text": "except the One Who created me; He will surely guide me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 25,
