      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4353,
      "text": "And he made it[9] a lasting word among his descendants, so that they may return [to Allah].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4354,
      "text": "However, I let these [Makkans] and their forefathers[10] enjoy their lives, until there came to them the truth and a clear messenger[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4355,
      "text": "But when the truth came to them, they said, “This is magic, and we definitely reject it.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4356,
      "text": "And they said, “Why was this Qur’an not sent down to a great man from one of the two towns[12]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4357,
      "text": "Is it they who distribute the mercy of your Lord? It is We Who have distributed their livelihood among them in the life of this world, and have raised some of them above others in ranks, so that they may serve one another. But the mercy of your Lord is better than what they accumulate.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 491,
      "ruku": 426,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4358,
      "text": "Were it not that all people might become a single community [of disbelievers][13], We would have given those who disbelieve in the Most Compassionate One houses of sliver roofs and staircases to ascend,",
